{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_computation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_computation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_computation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.ns_obstruction_computation","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L49-L60","doc":"**NS obstruction computation** ([`prop:ns-obstruction-computation`]).\n\n(i) `lk · e(ξ)|_p ≠ 0 ↔` Reeb zero at `p`; (ii) `δ_n|_Σ ≠ 0 ↔` the\n`n`-th jet diverges (`n ≥ 1`).  Both iffs are *derived* by `Iff.intro`\nfrom the four directional hypotheses. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:ns-obstruction-computation","label":"prop:ns-obstruction-computation","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/ns-obstruction-computation.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.delta_of_jet_diverges","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.delta_of_jet_diverges","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L47-L47","doc":"**(ii) ⇐:** jet divergence exhibits a non-vanishing jet obstruction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.jet_diverges_of_delta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.jet_diverges_of_delta","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L45-L45","doc":"**(ii) ⇒:** a non-vanishing jet obstruction forces jet divergence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.jet_diverges","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.jet_diverges","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L43-L43","doc":"Predicate: the `n`-th jet of the velocity diverges on `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.delta_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.delta_n","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L41-L41","doc":"Per-jet-level obstruction `δ_n` restricted to the collision surface `Σ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.obstruction_of_reeb_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.obstruction_of_reeb_zero","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L39-L39","doc":"**(i) ⇐:** a Reeb zero at `p` forces the obstruction `lk · e(ξ)|_p ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.reeb_zero_of_obstruction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.reeb_zero_of_obstruction","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L37-L37","doc":"**(i) ⇒:** a non-vanishing topological obstruction forces a Reeb zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.reeb_zero_at_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.reeb_zero_at_p","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Predicate: the Reeb field has a zero at `p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.e_xi_at_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.e_xi_at_p","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Euler class value `e(ξ)|_p` at the collision point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.lk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.lk","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Linking number `lk` of the colliding vortex pair. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L29-L29","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.NsObstructionComputationContext","kind":"class","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/ns_obstruction_computation.lean#L26-L47","doc":"Hypotheses for the NS obstruction computation (§7c: generic `CommRing`,\n`ℤ` linking number, no `ℝ`).  The four implication directions are\nexplicit; `ns_obstruction_computation` derives the two iffs. ","signatureChunk":0}]}